e from  the get-go  thrilling action sequences along with  some heart-wrenching drama  make this my pick for anime of the  season now while i wouldn't call it an  underappreciated anime by any means  i do think that more people need to  check out this show  there we have it my top 10 picks for  spring 2021 do you agree with my picks  or not  share your thoughts in the comments  section if you ended up enjoying the  video and the recommendations you may  want to check out some perks that vinnie  tube offers i set some exclusive videos  for the channel that you can access  through channel memberships if you're up  for some specific titles such as re zero  or sword art online you can head over  and get some memberships for you and  your friends speaking of those titles  videos on those are also available on my  other channel vini tube kai  it's a channel that deals more with  video essays and analysis videos so if  you fancy that sort of content head on  over there through the link that i'll be  dropping that's it for today  hope you had fun until next time

